						'''
						{$Common.RogueStealth}
						[c/{1}:Sandsmoke Bomb - {2} to shroud yourself in a small cloud of sand]
						[c/CCB648:While the sand cloud is active, gain increased mobility but heavily reduced defense]
						[c/CCB648:Using a spy weapon instantly dispels the sand cloak, but guarantees a supercrit for {3}% damage]
						[c/CCB648:The supercrit applies only as long as the resulting hit wouldn't exceed {4} damage]
