		SeaKing:
		{
			Help:
			{
				Hardmode2: If you take an idol down to the Brimstone Crag you might be able to see just what is lurking in the shadows.
				Hardmode3: Azafure, the city founded in the Brimstone Crag, was one of the first places to support Yharim in his war. Now, it is nothing more than ruins... Just what happened there?
				PreHardmode2: Have you heard of the city in the Brimstone Crag? It lies in the Underworld, and was constructed beneath the Abyss. It was once the oldest and largest city in the world, though it seems nothing but danger lies there now. It would be wise to avoid it.
			}
		}
